Subject: [PATCH 10/15] =?UTF-8?q?arm64/rk3576:=20eMMC=20=E5=9D=97=E8=AE=BE?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E5=A4=87=E8=AF=BB=E9=80=9A=EF=BC=881=20=E4=BD=8D=20@50MHz?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=EF=BC=89=EF=BC=8C4=20=E4=BD=8D=E5=BE=85=E4=BF=AE?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
